# mm.sdcard tests

Drives SpiCard against a byte-level model of an SD card in SPI mode behind a
fake mm.mcu platform: SDHC, version 2 SDSC, and version 1 SDSC
initialisation and addressing, the CRCs, single and multiple block reads and
writes, argument checks, the identification and data clocks, chip select
between operations, and a missing card, one that never leaves idle, a
corrupt read, and a card pulled mid-transfer and put back.
